{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hi Gina! I just wanted to fill you in on my business. Yesterday, I went to a fair to show off my studio, it was both stressful and great! I got some possible leads, so that was awesome. But overall, I've learned that this biz is no cakewalk and having confidence in yourself is important for making it successful!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-9c85fafe583668624ef860e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.394338+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c85fafe583668624ef860e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c85fafe583668624ef860e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon, congrats on the fair! It's awesome to see your hard work paying off. Keep on pushing, pal, you're headed for greatness. Oh, and BTW, I started my own online clothing store not so long ago - pretty cool, huh?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-c3d12722f971a1181a7ca044", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.435488+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c3d12722f971a1181a7ca044", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c3d12722f971a1181a7ca044", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! Appreciate your support. Your store looks great, I remember it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-e353289f3762c5eb8f5e4c2f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.466109+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e353289f3762c5eb8f5e4c2f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e353289f3762c5eb8f5e4c2f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks, Jon! After losing my job, I wanted to take control of my own destiny and this seemed like the perfect way to do it. It's been a tough journey, but very rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-8d29b3e9fb9f89cbf1dde4ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.489126+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8d29b3e9fb9f89cbf1dde4ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8d29b3e9fb9f89cbf1dde4ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, you're awesome for going for it! Setbacks can help us reach our potential, right? I'm having trouble with my business project. Any advice on staying motivated even when times are tough?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-f4b6f1817909b35f246c7b81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.506867+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f4b6f1817909b35f246c7b81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f4b6f1817909b35f246c7b81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah Jon! Challenges are awesome for learning and growth. To stay motivated, I think of the big goal and why I'm doing it. I also get help from people who support me. And of course, I dance it out. Do you need advice on anything in particular?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-44a46afa02e2641cf56fbac9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.527642+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "44a46afa02e2641cf56fbac9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "44a46afa02e2641cf56fbac9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I've been feeling kinda low on confidence lately. It's hard to run a business when you don't have faith in yourself. Any tips on how you stay confident in your business?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-96f0ae121a075b0174d50e06", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.547582+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "96f0ae121a075b0174d50e06", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "96f0ae121a075b0174d50e06", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I get it, Jon. Confidence is important in business. I stay motivated by reminding myself of my successes and progress. It also helps to have a good support system. Just focus on why you started this \u2013 because you love it! Have faith in yourself, Jon. I do!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-a219821b944491b996193aa5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.565938+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a219821b944491b996193aa5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a219821b944491b996193aa5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your words mean a lot. Gotta focus on success and why I started. You're right, I love it and that'll keep my confidence up."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-6954c7313ed6edeebfbfc024", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.584888+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6954c7313ed6edeebfbfc024", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6954c7313ed6edeebfbfc024", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No worries, Jon! Sounds like what I said was helpful. You're incredibly talented and passionate about dance. Don't forget, believe in yourself and your abilities. Tackle any obstacle that comes your way and keep shining!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-bdf053ed73681fda92fe876b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.600413+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bdf053ed73681fda92fe876b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bdf053ed73681fda92fe876b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and reach my dreams no matter what."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-77fa1cd1a9db81bffba6b70c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.618483+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "77fa1cd1a9db81bffba6b70c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "77fa1cd1a9db81bffba6b70c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Go for it, Jon! You got this! Don't let anything stop you. We're in this together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-39a249a53b3ccff25e1ea9ab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.634141+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "39a249a53b3ccff25e1ea9ab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "39a249a53b3ccff25e1ea9ab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Appreciate your encouragement. We'll keep pushing each other on this path."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-584174e8e46f6040f32f82c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.649735+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "584174e8e46f6040f32f82c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "584174e8e46f6040f32f82c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah! Let's keep each other going. We can do it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_10-27ea31a0b353f246a2238563", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:02:26.667235+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "27ea31a0b353f246a2238563", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "27ea31a0b353f246a2238563", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
